{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028050020925-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028063321\"/><p>火警現場噴出黑煙。</p><p>荃灣發生火警，現場在眾安街68號千色匯，今日(28日)凌晨4時34分，多名市民報案，指上址一食肆冒出濃煙，大廈排風口噴出黑煙沖天。消防到場開動1條吸及派出1隊煙帽隊撲救，其後將火救熄，火警起因有待調查。事件中毋須疏散，無人受傷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T22:40:19.706014+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T21:00:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:29.581763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:29.581763+00:00","content_hash":"387ad2f7e9cf4baf7ae36bdac926683ff27570c5692b86822aa707b7f82ddba8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}